    "text": "By FOX 11 Digital Team ,\n1 days ago Former CHP officer Angelo Rodriguez and Iris Salmeron faced court Tuesday for the 2025 freeway crash that killed four young adults in Norwalk. Prosecutors allege Rodriguez struck the victims' car at 130 mph without sirens, then hid his involvement for minutes before a drunk Salmeron hit the disabled vehicle at 110 mph. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
